      "en": "“You shall not follow a crowd to do evil. You shall not testify in court to side with a multitude to pervert justice.",
      "ko": "다수를 따라 악을 행하지 말며 송사에 다수를 따라 부정당한 증거를 하지 말며",
      "source_text_hash": "55e9b56b3552268930626fbe745d215d4338e18f81708f3195697f4a3b75f1a1",
      "translation_text_hash": "f4ceb666b0b03722d940dc880e6702dc699dd6173d309e870f29d8401b6f40b7",
