      "en": "“You shall not deny justice to your poor people in their lawsuits.",
      "ko": "너는 가난한 자의 송사라고 공평치 않게 하지 말며",
      "source_text_hash": "502e202c812e436a9eb34cc5ccb89ab0098b52957d7484dea82130b6ebb9b429",
      "translation_text_hash": "d956c1036a661a7ae5c907b74f0cb3576afb0b4a433ea02dac8ad3b477e44821",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
