      "en": "“You shall not oppress an alien, for you know the heart of an alien, since you were aliens in the land of Egypt.",
      "ko": "너는 이방 나그네를 압제하지 말라 너희가 애굽 땅에서 나그네 되었었은즉 나그네의 정경을 아느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b4269dbe60ceb77418378cb81c091b0be459b7bbf35b5916d738db80a85cf4d9",
      "translation_text_hash": "843c9543103c504a143c4ae1a3b1b994d9563b74fca9a2f053318e01cae8642f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
